{"id":"n87995-1-7","stage":5,"title":"화물 · 货","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87995-1-7-1","ko":"이 많은 화물들을 모두 어디로 보내는 건가요?","zh":"这么多货物都要寄到哪里去呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"화물들을","meaning":"货，货物","explanation":"화물：货，货物；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"화물","audio":"/audio/81e77c2d94427bf6fb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87995","senseId":"1","lemma":"화물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화물들을","audio":"/audio/d2523aa9cef6470e6ee4.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"보내는","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1